    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d244">

                <pb facs="0277" n="1111" xml:id="pg1111"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 657.119/231</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Norway</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Schmedeman</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Christiania</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-01-10T15:00:00+01:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 10, 1918—3 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 5.25 p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>455. Sent note to Foreign Office yesterday in the sense of your telegram No. 201,
                    January 4, 7 p.m. British Minister has done likewise. London informed.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Schmedeman</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
